  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CPE-Strengthening local antidiscrimination capacities and institutional</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Name of the project: Strengthening local antidiscrimination capacities and institutional capacities CPE. The overall objective is to to improve human and minority rights and social inclusion of marginalized groups in the Republic of Serbia. Target groups are local municipality representatives and citizens in general. Also, the target group is all employees of the CPE whose IT and data capacities will be improved.</narrative>
  </description>
